  stages:
  - title: The house from the photo
    lines:
    - "\u25CF A Jewish family lived in this house."
    - "\u25CF Halyna says they were killed during the war."
    - "\u25CF She doesn't know their family name."
    - "\u25CF They always shopped at the market on Fridays."
    - "\u25CF After the war, Halyna's family moved in."
